    - agent-runner: resolve context/reserve budgets once per startup in a
      shared headless/TUI helper with CLI > configuration > discovery
      precedence and no assumed 8192 fallback; absent capacity fails with
      an actionable diagnostic; resolved provenance recorded in journals,
      run_start and the UI
    - token accounting stays honest: TokenAccounting (provider/estimated/
      unavailable) in progress events, TUI markers, nullable journal usage
      with per-prompt resets and terminal failures persisted
    - length-truncated generations regenerate before any effects with a
      doubled reserve within the shared window/token/attempt budgets;
      truncated proposals are recorded, never dispatched; final answers
      require an ordinary complete stop
    - compaction: capacity-based retention (75% trigger to 65% target)
      instead of a fixed six-group ceiling; outstanding user goals retained
      until an answer completes the task; summaries keep path/offset/digest
      references before lossy prefixes
