      outcomes reset consecutive stalls
    - tool results: binary output becomes size+sha256, previews bounded by
      encoded escaped-JSON cost; search/discovery prune generated trees by
      default (include_generated opts in), add literal file_pattern,
      regular-file scopes and skipped/excluded/complete coverage; oversized
      scanned files are metadata-skipped; TOCTOU-safe directory traversal
    - new rust_environment: host-resolved already-installed toolchain
      (project pin or system rustup default, never PATH/repo config)
      mounted read-only under /rust with hashed drift checks, bounded
      private .kvist/vendored snapshot, trusted Cargo shim forcing
      --offline --locked with sandbox-native source paths, private scratch,
      denied network; pin drift fails closed before effects
    - ROOT_CONTRACT, engine and sandbox-runner requirements: unsafe Rust
      is not categorically prohibited but must be necessary, minimally
      scoped, documented, verified and reviewed; sandboxed Cargo builds
      use --offline --locked with separately provisioned locks/vendored
    - intent, contract, design, queue, README, hardening guide and
      re-derived IMPL records updated; new tests in model_budgets,
      model_capacity, rust_build_environment and across existing suites
    
    Validation: workspace build and strict clippy clean; 1226 tests pass,
    0 fail, 7 ignored (opt-in native bwrap/live-provider trials). The
    four security/compliance queue entries record their independent
    contexts; component revisions remain stale pending revalidation.

